# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
# Without this, a contributor with core.autocrlf=true checks out CRLF and
# `npm run format:check` fails on every file, since Prettier defaults to
# endOfLine: "lf". This matches .editorconfig's `end_of_line = lf`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never convert.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
